# AI Configuration

This project uses AI IDE configuration managed by ar-sync.

## Configuration Structure

All AI prompts, rules, and context are stored in `.prompts/`:

```
.prompts/
├── agents/    # Role-based AI assistants
├── rules/     # Coding guidelines and patterns
└── skills/    # Specialized knowledge modules
```

## IDE Compatibility

This configuration works with:
- Claude: Reads AGENTS.md and .prompts/
- Cursor: Reads AGENTS.md and can reference .prompts/
- Kiro: Reads AGENTS.md and .kiro/steering/
- Generic: Any IDE supporting AGENTS.md or .prompts/ directory

